  "notes": "Warm paper palette (cream #f3f0e8 page, #fffdf8 panels) against a deep blue-black sidebar and a teal primary (#1f5a6b). Each code has its own pastel colour chip (red request for help, pink unclear, purple venting, green offer, blue logistics, teal resource sharing, grey rule, amber gratitude, taupe off-topic), and the chips repeat across the table and the disagreement pairs. The in-cell κ bars combine a filled bar, a thin grey 95% CI line underneath and a black 0.75 threshold tick, a bullet-chart style. The UI is built around a research-governance gate: a narrative 'finding' banner states the insight in prose with exact counts, and a policy panel with a disabled Accept button explains why it is blocked. The sidebar repeats the same gate status. A serif headline gives the screen an academic voice. In the live copy, clicking a row opens a separate three-column Disagreements review page (list, post detail, reason choices)."
